NR', '301H', 2020, 'Honors Social Science', 'Discussion and investigation of topics in anthropology, econimics, geography, political science, psychology, or sociology. Course content varies and may link two or more of these disciplines. Prerequisites: Admisson to the Honors Program or permission of the University Honors Council. (May be repeated for up to six hours of credit.)', 3.0000, 3.0000, 6.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139795, 985634, 'HIST', '491B', 2020, 'Directed Study: European History (Formerly HIST 491B)', '1-3 credits each. Directed study and/or research in selected areas of history. Prerequisite: Advanced standing and approval of department head. (Formerly HIST 491B)', 1.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139796, 617963, 'HIST', '300J', 2020, 'Directed Study: Eyes On the Prize (Formerly HIST 300J)', 'Selected studies in history. (Formerly HIST 300J)', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139797, 25274, 'HIST', '4008', 2020, 'Contemporary History', 'A historical perspective on issues and events of the contemporary world. Prerequisites: HIST 1012 or 2002 or instructor consent.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139798, 25274, 'HIST', '408', 2020, 'Contemporary History', 'A historical perspective on issues and events of the contemporary world. Prerequisites: HIST 1012 or 2002 or instructor consent.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139799, 838583, 'HIST', '209H', 2020, 'Honors History', 'An introduction to the worlds major ideas and historical developments from the 1500s through the 1700s. This course will emphasize the contributions of the diverse civilizations to the formation of the modern world. Prerequisite: Admission to the Honors Program or permission of the Honors Council. Substitutes for History 1012. (Formerly HIST 209H)', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139800, 768897, 'HUMN', '110C', 2020, 'Fine Arts Appreciation: Britain (Formerly HUMN 110C)', '1 credit; maximum, 3 credits. Credit is given for attendance of selected cultural attractions.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139801, 82462, 'GRMN', '1098', 2020, 'Beginning German', 'Independent reading, grammar, and/or conversation on the elementary level. Prerequisite: 1002 or 1005.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139802, 809522, 'GRMN', '1099', 2020, 'Beginning German', 'Independent reading, grammar, and/or conversation on the elementary level. Prerequisite: 1002 or 1005.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139803, 965560, 'GRMN', '205', 2020, 'Intermediate German I and II', 'Same as GRMN 2001 and 2002. A continuation of 1001-1002, with an increased emphasis upon reading and discussion. Work in the computerized Language Learning Center is required. Prerequisite: 1002 OR 1005', 6.0000, 6.0000, 6.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139804, 409599, 'HIST', '2002', 2020, 'United States History II', 'Survey of the political, economic, social, and cultural foundations of American life with emphasis upon the rise of the United States as a world power. 2001: To 1877. 2002: Since 1877.<br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\nLCCN: CHIS 2023', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139805, 429694, 'FRNH', '4004', 2020, 'Seminar in French Literature', '3 credits; maximum 6 credits. An in-depth analysis of a literary movement or writer of French literature. Prerequisite: 2002 or 2005 or the equivalent.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 6.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139806, 664150, 'FRNH', '4015', 2020, 'Advanced Language Development', 'Advanced language instruction with emphasis on French grammar and civilization including French history, history of art, cinema, geography, and literature. All classes are taught in French. Prerequisite: 2005 or permission of the department head.', 3.0000, 12.0000, 12.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139808, 557959, 'HLST', '4003', 2020, 'Health Science Practicum II', 'This is a practicum performed in the student&#39;s senior year. Under supervision in an approved agency, the student will have the opportunity for on-the-job experiences. The practicum is project-based in that the student is expected to produce tangible output for the host organization. It is expected that the student will select a practicum site which is consistent with career intersts and objectives. Prerequisites: Health Studies majors only. HLST 303, HLST 304, and senior standing; completion of 90 credit hours toward Health Studies degree; completion of 15 credit hours of HLST courses.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139809, 848910, 'GRMN', '197', 2020, 'Beginning German', 'Independent reading, grammar, and/or conversation on the elementary level. Prerequisite: 1002 or 1005.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139810, 899272, 'GRMN', '409A', 2020, 'German Literature Since Goethe (Formerly GRMN 409A)', 'Topic: German literature since Goethe. 3 credits; maximum, 9 credits. Prerequisite: 2002, 2005, or permission of the department head. (Formerly GRMN 409A)', 3.0000, 3.0000, 9.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139811, 844057, 'FRNH', '3025', 2020, 'French Culture and Civilization', 'Maximum, 9 cr. Studies in the history and culture of the French World with continued emphasis on understanding, speaking, reading, and writing. Prerequisite: 2005 or permission of department head.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 9.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139812, 933047, 'FRNH', '3012', 2020, 'Phonetics', 'French phonetic system. Corrective and fluency drills in the language laboratory. Prerequisite: 2002, 2005 or equivalent or permission of the department head.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139813, 933047, 'FRNH', '312', 2020, 'Phonetics', 'French phonetic system. Corrective and fluency drills in the language laboratory. Prerequisite: 2002, 2005 or equivalent or permission of the department head.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (139814, 198812, 'FRNH', '1097', 2020, 'Beginning French', 'Independent reading, grammar, and/or conversation on the elementary level. prerequisite: 1002 or 1005.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (139815, 847017, 