00, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (140485, 33048, 'MUSC', '3073', 2020, 'Song Writing', 'Song writing investigated through listening, discussion, and practice. A survey of style, form and format, concluding with the production of student-composed songs. Prerequisite: MUSC 1001 or approval of instructor.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (140486, 196795, 'MUSC', '4087', 2020, 'Voice Pedagogy', 'A study of the teaching methods, techniques, and materials for the voice studio. Prerequisite: Music 3041 or senior standing. Required of all vocal performance majors.', 2.0000, 2.0000, 2.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (140487, 628220, 'MUSC', '4084', 2020, 'Brass Literature', 'Solo and chamber music written for brass instruments. Prerequisite: MUSC 193.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (140488, 891978, 'MUSC', '4081', 2020, 'Analysis of Contemporary Music', 'An overview of techniques used in the analysis of the music of the 20th century and beyond.', 2.0000, 2.0000, 2.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (140489, 269450, 'MUSC', '4083', 2020, 'Woodwind Literature', 'Solo and chamber music written for woodwind instruments. Prerequisite: MUSC 1093.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (140490, 119160, 'MUSC', '4085', 2020, 'American', '(Formerly 591.) American music from early Colonial times to the present, including music of different races NURSING 193 and ethnic groups. Prerequisite: MUSC 491, 492, or approval of the Head of the Division of Music.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (140491, 459115, 'MUSC', '4078', 2020, 'Eighteenth Century Counterpoint', 'The Study of contrapuntal compositional techniques concentrating on 18th Century Counterpoint. Prerequisite: MUSC 204 or equivalent.', 2.0000, 2.0000, 2.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (140492, 617350, 'MUSC', '472', 2020, 'Composition II', 'Maximum, 6 cr. Compositions in one or more movements for various solo instruments, vocal and instrumental ensembles and full orchestra. Students enrolled will serve as supervised tutors for