ntury works and composers.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141525, 758714, 'THEA', '4016', 2020, 'Theatre History II', 'Studies the history of theatre art and dramatic literature from 1700 to the present day. Emphasis is placed on historical research in preparation of seminar presentations and research papers. Prerequisite: HIST 1011, 1012 or consent of instructor.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141526, 2732, 'THEA', '4085', 2020, 'Internship', 'Provides an opportunity to work as an intern in a professional Theatre. Student must prepare a contract specifying the duties to be performed as an intern and the means and person who will evaluate the students work. Contract must be signed by the student, the intern supervisor and the Director of Theater. Prerequisite: Permission of the Director of Theater.', 3.0000, 6.0000, 6.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141532, 616205, 'ART', '2003', 2020, 'Handbuilding Ceramics', 'Lectures and demonstrations on fundamental methods of forming, glazing, and firing ceramics. One hour lecture and five hours studio. Additional course fee .', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141533, 458095, 'MUSC', '1034', 2020, 'French Horn', 'Performance - Minor. May be repeated for a maximum of 3 hours of credits.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141534, 31397, 'MUSC', '1053', 2020, 'Trumpet', 'Performance - Major. May be repeated for a maximum of 6 hours of credit.', 2.0000, 2.0000, 6.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141535, 526707, 'MUSC', '2056', 2020, 'Trombone', 'Performance - Major. May be repeated for a maximum of 6 hours of credit.', 2.0000, 2.0000, 6.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141536, 368140, 'MUSC', '4054', 2020, 'Tuba', 'Performance - Major. May be repeated for a maximum of 6 hours of credit.', 2.0000, 2.0000, 6.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141538, 172846, 'MUSC', '1030', 2020, 'Bassoon', 'Performance - Minor. May be repeated for a maximum of 3 hours of credits.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (141539, 485433, 'MUSC', '10