, legal, and ethical implications of past, present, and future discoveries. Prerequisite: \"C\" or better in 1020 and 2014, or permission of the instructor. (Formerly BIOL 411B)', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (142885, 485181, 'BIOL', '424', 2020, 'Embryology', 'The structure and maturation of germ cells, the fertilization and early development of vertebrates. Three hours lecture and three hours laboratory. Prerequisite: 208. (Formerly Zoology 419, 420.)', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142886, 919477, 'BIOL', '4019', 2020, 'Advanced Concepts in Genetic and Molecular Biology', 'An advanced level course in genetics with a focus on DNA structure and function, gene expression, protein function, human genetics, and biotechnology. An emphasis is placed on current topics and emerging biomedical technologies. Prerequisite: \"C\" or better in BIOL 3005.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (142887, 381998, 'BOTN', '2005', 2020, 'Plant Diversity Laboratory', 'A laboratory course in plant diversity to accompany 2004. Prerequisites: Credit or registration in 2004. (Formerly Botany 205.)\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nLCCN: CBIO 2311', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142888, 381998, 'BOTN', '205', 2020, 'Plant Diversity Laboratory', 'A laboratory course in plant diversity to accompany 2004. Prerequisites: Credit or registration in 2004. (Formerly Botany 205.)\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nLCCN: CBIO 2311', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142889, 169429, 'BIOL', '426', 2020, 'Neurology Laboratory', 'A laboratory course to accompany 4025. Three hours laboratory. Prerequisite: Credit or registration in 4025.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142890, 755834, 'BIOL', '4034', 2020, 'Field Botany', 'Field characteristics and sight identification of the regional flora is emphasized. Two hours lecture and four hours laboratory including frequent field trips. Prerequisite: \"C\" or better in 1022, 1023.', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (142891, 75583