y', 'The study of plant populations and communities and their habitat with emphasis on the communities of the south central United States. Three hours lecture and three hours laboratory. Prerequisite: \"C\" or better in 3002.', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (142898, 915892, 'BIOL', '444', 2020, 'Plant Ecology', 'The study of plant populations and communities and their habitat with emphasis on the communities of the south central United States. Three hours lecture and three hours laboratory. Prerequisite: \"C\" or better in 3002.', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142899, 23610, 'BIOL', '4051', 2020, 'Field Biology', 'Field studies of the flora and fauna native to selected habitats. Field trip fee required. Prerequisites: \"C\" or better in 2004, 2005, 2010; or \"C\" or better in 2030; or approval of department head.', 6.0000, 6.0000, 6.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (142900, 667782, 'BIOL', '447', 2020, 'Economic Botany Laboratory', 'A laboratory course to accompany 446. Two hours laboratory. Prerequisite: Credit or registration in 446. (Formerly Botany 482.)', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142901, 667782, 'BOTN', '447', 2020, 'Economic Botany Laboratory', 'A laboratory course to accompany 446. Two hours laboratory. Prerequisite: Credit or registration in 446. (Formerly Botany 482.)', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142903, 213733, 'BIOL', '456', 2020, 'Introduction to Entomology', 'The anatomy, physiology, and classification of insects. Three hours lecture and three hours laboratory. Prerequisite: 208. (Formerly Zoology 450, 451.)', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142904, 936613, 'MICR', '424', 2020, 'Food and Dairy Micro Laboratory', 'A laboratory course to accompany 4062. Three hours laboratory. Prerequisite: Credit with \"C\" or better or registration in 4062.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (142905, 795080, 'BIOL', '462', 2020, 'Food and Dairy Microbiology', 'The role of microorganisms in the preservation, spoilag