tin. Prerequisite: LATN 1002 or 1005 or permission of department head.', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143375, 72013, 'SPAN', '102', 2020, 'Elementary Spanish II', 'A continuation of the study of Spanish on the elementary level.Prerequisite: A \"C\" or better in SPAN 1001 or permission of Department Head.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nLCCN: CPSN 1023', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143377, 677522, 'LATN', '203', 2020, 'Classical Studies', 'Topics in Roman civilization, culture, language, literature, and religion. Prerequisite: LATN 1002 or permission of the department head.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143378, 107773, 'LATN', '208', 2020, 'Literature of the Late Republic', '1-3 credits; maximum, 3 credits. Prerequisite: LATN 2002 or approval of department head.', 1.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143379, 286725, 'MNSC', '4002', 2020, 'Wetland Vegetation', 'Identification, taxonomy and distribution of wetland plants. Plant adaptions, vegetation analysis methods, marsh types, community processes, and coastal wetland restoration will also be discussed. Prerequisites: junior or senior standing or permission of instructor. Three weeks. LUMCON Summer course; alternating years.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (143380, 324254, 'LATN', '3008', 2020, 'Literature of the Golden Age', '1-3 credits; maximum, 3 credits. Prerequisite: LATN 2002 or approval of the department head.', 1.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (143381, 632453, 'LATN', '401', 2020, 'Advanced Readings in Latin', '3 credits; maximum 6 credits. Study in Latin of a specific author or literary genre. Prerequisite: LATN 2002 or equivalent.', 3.0000, 3.0000, 6.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143382, 800126, 'LATN', '408', 2020, 'Literature of the Silver Age', '1-3 credits; maximum, 3 credits. Prerequisite: LATN 2002 or approval of department head.', 1.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143383, 347399, 'LATN', '418', 2020, 'Medieval Latin', '1-3 credits; maximum, 3 credits. Prerequisite: LATN 2002 or approval of department head.', 1.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143387, 449655, 'LIBR', '452', 2020, 'Library Practicum', 'Designed to give the prospective library media specialist supervised experience in all phases of librarianship. A minimum of six hours per week (100 total clock hours) at a designated site. Prerequisites: 3001, 3003, 3007, 4001, 4005, or consent of instructor. Must be admitted to Teacher Education.', 3.0000, 6.0000, 6.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143393, 889818, 'MATH', '132', 2020, 'Calculus II', 'Inverse functions, techniques of integration, applications of the integral, sequences and series. Prerequisite: A grade of \"C\" or better in MATH 1031.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nLCCN: CMAT 2124', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143394, 380982, 'BIOL', '121', 2020, 'Principles of Biology I Laboratory', 'A laboratory designed to accompany 1020. Prerequisites: credit or registration in 1020.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nLCCN: CBIO 1031', 1.0000, 1.0000, 1.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143395, 385982, 'MATH', '2032', 2020, 'Calculus III', 'Vectors, lines, and planes, vector valued functions, partial derivatives, multiple integrals, calculus of vector fields. Prerequisite: A grade of &quot;C&quot; or better in MATH 1032. Sp', 4.0000, 4.0000, 4.0000, 0, NULL, 0, 0), (143396, 187298, 'MATH', '202', 2020, 'Applied Linear Algebra', 'An introduction to the application of matrix algebra. Emphasis on the application of procedures and algorithms. Prerequisite: A grade of &quot;C&quot; or better in MATH 1031 or 1014. Sp', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143397, 260482, 'MATH', '240', 2020, 'Foundations of Mathematics', 'Introduction to logic and proofs, set theory, functions and structures relating to algebra and analysis. Prerequisite: A grade of &quot;C&quot; or better in MATH 1031. F', 3.0000, 3.0000, 3.0000, 1, NULL, 0, 0), (143398, 103509, 'MATH', '3050', 2020, 'Geometry and Measurement for Elem Teachers', 'Students will analyze Euclidian